{"type":"message","id":"a61e8bda","parentId":"25e481af","timestamp":"2026-03-14T06:59:33.309Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The gateway is currently bound to loopback (127.0.0.1) which only allows local connections. I need to:\n\n1. Reconfigure the gateway to use Tailscale IP instead of localhost\n2. Make sure it listens on all interfaces or specifically on the Tailscale interface\n\nLooking at the openclaw.json file, I see:\n```json\n\"gateway\": {\n    \"port\": 18789,\n    \"mode\": \"local\",\n    \"bind\": \"loopback\",\n...\n}\n```\n\nThe \"bind\": \"loopback\" is what's restricting it to localhost. I need to change this to allow Tailscale connections. However, changing \"mode\": \"local\" might not be the right approach - that's likely referring to the API mode (OpenAI-compatible vs WebSocket).\n\nFor Tailscale access, I should:\n1. Change bind from \"loopback\" to either \"0.0.0.0\" or a specific Tailscale IP\n2. Keep mode as is if it refers to API compatibility\n\nBut actually, looking at the gateway status output more carefully:\n```\nGateway: bind=loopback (127.0.0.1), port=18789 (service args)\nProbe target: ws://127.0.0.1:18789\nDashboard: http://127.0.0.1:18789/\n```\n\nThis suggests the gateway is running in \"local\" mode which might be a different concept from API mode. Let me check what options are available.\n\nActually, re-reading the tool description and looking at common OpenClaw configurations, I think:\n- \"mode\": \"local\" might refer to whether it's using local loopback vs remote connections\n\n\n- \"bind\": \"loopback\" explicitly restricts binding to localhost\n\nFor Tailscale access, I need to bind to 0.0.0.0 so the gateway listens on all network interfaces and accepts Tailscale connections. This is a configuration change that requires careful consideration of security implications - exposing the service beyond localhost means anyone with Tailscale access could connect. However, this aligns with what the user requested."},{"type":"text","text":"I'll configure the gateway to accept Tailscale connections:\n\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"120744930","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\medo\\.openclaw\\openclaw.json","oldText":"\"gateway\": {\n    \"port\": 18789,\n    \"mode\": \"local\",\n    \"bind\": \"loopback\",","newText":"\"gateway\": {\n    \"port\": 18789,\n    \"mode\": \"tailscale\",\n    \"bind\": \"0.0.0.0\","}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"qwen3-5-9b","model":"qwen3.5-9b-claude-4.6-opus-reasoning-distilled","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773471424376}}
